    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is a work-in-progress build. Some CGs and story events are not yet implemented and will be added in future updates.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/49a8dd96de2051806e4db8b62bd8c46b.avif?t=1754363180\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>You run an old, second-hand electronics recycling shop, buying up discarded phones, laptops, and tablets. On the surface, it\u2019s just a dull little business\u2014but beneath it lurks countless irresistible temptations\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people forget to delete their personal files. Some try to hide secrets they never want revealed. You are the one who holds the key to unlocking them all. Will you quietly profit from this knowledge, or use it to push them step by step into submission? When she is out of options, when she fears exposure, when she can no longer resist your demands\u2026 how much choice does she really have left?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a simple buy-and-sell business. It\u2019s a transaction fueled by money, desire, and control. The value of information is beyond your imagination\u2014once you unlock the files, there\u2019s no turning back\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/b54ba36f83ea45ba3f8cd7bf42e3f0ec.poster.avif?t=1754363180\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/b54ba36f83ea45ba3f8cd7bf42e3f0ec.webm?t=1754363180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/b54ba36f83ea45ba3f8cd7bf42e3f0ec.mp4?t=1754363180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid